<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Ngai Lik shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Ngai Lik shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Ngai Lik Industrial Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the consumer audio products maker rose one cent to end at HK$1.93 per share on Wednesday on volume of 560,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
